WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.800
Hi, my name is Danny with

00:02.800 --> 00:05.100
Prestige Tractors and
Neale Goad Automotive.

00:05.720 --> 00:09.520
We've had the pleasure of working with
Evan Martinez for a little while now.

00:09.520 --> 00:13.860
He's been helping us build our websites
for both companies,

00:13.860 --> 00:15.900
as well as do Google Ads.

00:16.540 --> 00:18.580
Evan's very cluey in his department.

00:18.580 --> 00:21.640
He's also helped us grow our business with,

00:21.640 --> 00:25.120
probably, I'd say,
double our business capacity,

00:25.120 --> 00:27.540
as far as customers coming
in and out of the workshop,

00:27.540 --> 00:30.680
as well as tractor sales
in the Prestige Tractors side.

00:31.700 --> 00:34.180
Evan's always there to lend a hand,

00:34.280 --> 00:35.520
nothing seems to be too hard,

00:35.520 --> 00:38.840
and he's very cluey
in that sort of industry,

00:38.840 --> 00:41.400
so strongly recommend using him.
